## Overview

I led visual design for a suite of platform enhancements and worked with senior management and the UX team to establish the application's visual identity.

- Shipped a new visual language across the product suite.
- Shipped a tool for drafting, scheduling, and posting to social media.
- Improved the core email builder.
- Contributed front-end engineering for the visual language work.
